<title>SINGAPORE: OUE 1996 net profit flat at S$37.48 mln.</title>
<headline>OUE 1996 net profit flat at S$37.48 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   37.48     vs    37.46</p>
<p>    Dividend (cts)	     10.00     vs    10.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	  29.83     vs    29.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		    175.57     vs   171.51</p>
<p>    Investment income	  22.78     vs    17.29</p>
<p>    Other income		  1.97     vs     1.84</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    9.11     vs     9.25</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			53.32     vs    49.93</p>
<p>    Tax			    15.20     vs    11.97</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (0.64)    vs    (0.50)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    (0.55)    vs    (1.70)</p>
<p>    Dividend pay/ reg -   30 May 1997/ 19 May 1997</p>
<p>Note - Overseas Union Enterprise Ltd is a unit of Oveseas Union Bank group.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
